Comment: 7,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you
Comment: 7,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Human
Comment: 7,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.61,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,You fool！I'm a devil
Comment: 7,0:14:38.61,0:14:40.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,You think such a thing will work？
Comment: 7,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Where is Marin？
Comment: 7,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Marin？Marin？Marin！
Comment: 7,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Glasses and the kunoichi are looking for you
Comment: 7,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and untie me.
Comment: 7,0:15:02.01,0:15:04.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,I won't use my powers for something simple！
